WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.160
What did it say?

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:06.640
The voicemail.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.240
Doesn't matter.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:10.840
It was ages ago.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.560
It matters to me.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.120
It was something like:

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.400
"Hi, Maeve.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.040
I'm watching you
on TV right now.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.680
And I wanted to let you know
how proud I am of you.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.320
And about how you saying
you had feelings for me

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.840
was all I ever wanted
to hear.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.720
Because
it's always been you.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.040
I love you."

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.760
Anyway, it was… stupid.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.920
Did you mean it?

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.560
Did you mean it?

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:30.760
Of course I meant it.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.240
I can't… I can't do this.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.120
I understand.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.600
I…

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.880
I don't want
to lose you again.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.160
I'm confused.
This is confusing me.

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:26.520
Ruby, don't look.

